", "companyName": "[Cintas Corporation](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$COMPANY_260725)"}, "SEC000234912771": {"title": "[Cintas Corporation - 10-Q - 2024-11-30](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$DOCID_SEC000234912771)", "documentType": "10-Q", "date": "2025-01-08", "companyId": "260725", "companyName": "[Cintas Corporation](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$COMPANY_260725)"}, "SEC000244910768": {"title": "[Cintas Corporation - 10-K - 2025-05-31](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$DOCID_SEC000244910768)", "documentType": "10-K", "date": "2025-07-28", "companyId": "260725", "companyName": "[Cintas Corporation](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$COMPANY_260725)"}, "SEC000249584056": {"title": "[Cintas Corporation - 10-Q - 2025-08-31](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$DOCID_SEC000249584056)", "documentType": "10-Q", "date": "2025-10-08", "companyId": "260725", "companyName": "[Cintas Corporation](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$COMPANY_260725)"}, "SEC000220926050": {"title": "[Cintas Corporation - 10-Q - 2024-02-29](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$DOCID_SEC000220926050)", "documentType": "10-Q", "date": "2024-04-05", "companyId": "260725", "companyName": "[Cintas Corporation](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$COMPANY_260725)"}}}
{"sentenceId": "T000003627667-51", "text": "On that note, I want to briefly address the unsolicited nonbinding proposal we received from Cintas recently. [#51](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$SENTID_T000003627667-51)", "section": "EarningsCalls_PresenterSpeech", "speakerType": "Executives_CEO"}
{"sentenceId": "T000003412615-103", "text": "As previously announced in January 2025, the UniFirst Board of Directors rejected an unsolicited proposal from Cintas to acquire the company after considering numerous factors, including the offer price, execution and business risk, feedback from some of the company's largest shareholders by voting power and the company's future growth and value creation opportunities. [#103](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$SENTID_T000003412615-103)", "section": "EarningsCalls_PresenterSpeech", "speakerType": "Executives_CEO"}
{"sentenceId": "T000003412615-106", "text": "Ultimately, those discussions ceased as referenced in Cintas' press release from last week. [#106](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$SENTID_T000003412615-106)", "section": "EarningsCalls_PresenterSpeech", "speakerType": "Executives_CEO"}
{"sentenceId": "T000003408143-110", "text": "The Cintas has terminated discussions with UniFirst regarding Cintas' proposal to acquire UniFirst for $275 per share in cash. [#110](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$SENTID_T000003408143-110)", "section": "EarningsCalls_PresenterSpeech", "speakerType": "Executives_CEO"}
{"sentenceId": "T000003353232-103", "text": "As a result, we won't be commenting further on Cintas. [#103](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$SENTID_T000003353232-103)", "section": "EarningsCalls_PresenterSpeech", "speakerType": "Executives_CFO"}
{"sentenceId": "T000003353232-20", "text": "As we stated in our press release yesterday, the UniFirst Board in consultation with its independent financial and legal advisers, carefully evaluated the unsolicited nonbinding proposal from Cintas and unanimously determined that it was not in the best interest of UniFirst, our shareholders and our other stakeholders. [#20](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$SENTID_T000003353232-20)", "section": "EarningsCalls_PresenterSpeech", "speakerType": "Executives_CEO"}
{"sentenceId": "T000003412615-116", "text": "Can you remind us because I think the offer from Cintas was unanimously regarded to be very compelling. [#116](https://gam.prontonlp.com/#/ref/$SENTID_T000003412615-116)", "section": "EarningsCalls_Question", "speakerType": "Analysts"}
